  "description": "Accept hair-raising missions to destroy enemy bases while avoiding getting shot down by the hail of bullets!\n\nChoose over 30 different aircraft and fly dozens of missions to knock down enemy Zeppelins and observation balloons while dodging enemy aircraft! Go on reconnaissance missions to photograph enemy movements and bring back accurate pictures for your bombers. Strafe enemy positions while supporting your troops on the ground!\n\nTrain with the Flying School tutorial and then Master your flying abilities with your customized aircraft. Join your Mechanic in the hangar and make improvements on your aircraft! Become famous by your amazing feats of daring do, earn promotions and fly the latest aircraft! Earn medals and awards as you master each mission while you lead your forces to victory!\n\nKey Features\n• Customize your aircraft\n• Historically based missions\n• Weapons include Rockets, Bombs and more\n• Earn medals and promotions through Achievements\n• Missions include Strafing, bombing, reconnaissance, escort and more\n• Different types of Missions: Bombing, Strafing, Air Patrol, Recon and more!",
